tificate of Analysis receive the Seatopia brand of approval.</p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="d05d04d4-5851-40e5-917c-e387e479f9fa" data-replo-repeated-index=".0.0.0.0.0.0" class="r-wbju41" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="91180099-65f2-4793-b5e2-e691cf357c01" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="replo-:Ramqu:" data-replo-repeated-index=".0.0.0.0.0.0.0" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-1cnw2yb"><div data-rid="a7f0616b-4edc-492f-a3b4-82a0c87a011b" data-replo-repeated-index=".0.0.0.0.0.0.0.0" class="r-18axvpm alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Explain Micro Plastics Free?</p></span></div><div data-rid="8f7c0684-5bb8-482e-abd3-bf217363ff9c" data-replo-repeated-index=".0.0.0.0.0.0.0.0" class="r-yamfg5"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="currentColor" stroke-width="0" viewBox="0 0 16 16" role="img" aria-label="Collapse/Expand" style="width:var(--rsw, 100%);height:100%" class="r-13kld79" height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M8 4a.5.5 0 0 1 .5.5v3h3a.5.5 0 0 1 0 1h-3v3a.5.5 0 0 1-1 0v-3h-3a.5.5 0 0 1 0-1h3v-3A.5.5 0 0 1 8 4"></path></svg></div></div><div hidden="" id="replo-:Ramqu:" aria-controls="replo-:Ramqu:" aria-expanded="false"><div data-rid="330d63f9-b1a3-42be-abd7-a6dbb12f067c" data-replo-repeated-index=".0.0.0.0.0.0.0" class="r-1qmikx9"><div data-rid="bbd7cc6d-3cd5-4660-89fb-d1947af2d3a0" data-replo-repeated-index=".0.0.0.0.0.0.0.0" class="r-1jm0sum alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>We also submit samples from every farm to be tested for microplastics. Concentration of microplastics in all measured size ranges were below the Limit of Quantitation (LOQ), which is 0.0094 particles per gram. This essentially means that no microplastics were detected in Seatopia samples tested.  In simpler terms, this is a good result suggesting that it is free from measurable microplastics, according to the sensitivity of the test performed. This should provide so