te="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="83db85aa-8a51-4868-97b9-269aa6a6be5c" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="replo-:Rqmqu:" data-replo-repeated-index=".0.0.0.0.0.0.0" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-onhmo5"><div data-rid="2ecd5af2-70e1-4b46-8c2c-2ac71d06000c" data-replo-repeated-index=".0.0.0.0.0.0.0.0" class="r-1iln7dn alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Why choose farmed seafood instead of wild-caught?</p></span></div><div data-rid="d02d417a-3f77-4944-aba9-f8c59757e022" data-replo-repeated-index=".0.0.0.0.0.0.0.0" class="r-1lpi51j"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="currentColor" stroke-width="0" viewBox="0 0 16 16" role="img" aria-label="Collapse/Expand" style="width:var(--rsw, 100%);height:100%" class="r-ujn4r0" height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M8 4a.5.5 0 0 1 .5.5v3h3a.5.5 0 0 1 0 1h-3v3a.5.5 0 0 1-1 0v-3h-3a.5.5 0 0 1 0-1h3v-3A.5.5 0 0 1 8 4"></path></svg></div></div><div hidden="" id="replo-:Rqmqu:" aria-controls="replo-:Rqmqu:" aria-expanded="false"><div data-rid="861f0bf6-5829-4c97-ada8-9fd79aed6297" data-replo-repeated-index=".0.0.0.0.0.0.0" data-alchemy-url-hashmark="accordion-overflow" tabindex="-1" id="accordion-overflow" data-alchemy-url-hashmark-ignore="true" class="r-rfwga9"><div data-rid="11e0f9d9-0c12-4749-a29a-495a86d24fcc" data-replo-repeated-index=".0.0.0.0.0.0.0.0" class="r-bg5023 alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p><strong>Cleaner Profile</strong><br>Thanks to our stringent farming practices, specific species selection, and certified clean feed, our farm-raised seafood contains lower levels of mercury, PCBs, and microplastics compared to many wild-caught alternatives.</p></span></div><div data-rid="c8644b94-dd36-4059-852f-76109db50e98" data-replo-repeated-index=".0.0.0.0.0.0.0.0" class="r-avwvet alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p><strong>Nutrient-Rich</strong><br>Our seafood is higher in essential nutrients and omega-3 fatty acids. This is because we control the diets of our fish to optimize their health benefits, ensuring they are fed a balanced diet rich in the nutrients that matter most.</p></span></div><div data-rid="c5c090dc-543f-4d78-aaed-6659846df24b" data-replo-repeated-index=".0.0.0.0.0.0.0.0" class="r-yaw9uz alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p><strong>Natural Coloring</strong><br>Just like wild-caught fish, the vibrant colors of our farm-raised seafood come from a diet high in antioxidant-rich micro-algae, specifically astaxanthin. This means you're getting a product that's not only beautiful but also natural.</p></span></div><div data-rid="928e5f2f-2202-47a6-8f9a-f05c65b3c0aa" data-replo-repeated-index=".0.0.0.0.0.0.0.0" class="r-192fiff alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p><strong>No Antibiotics or Hormones<br></strong>We're committed to raising our seafood without the use of antibiotics or hormones. This aligns with our ethos of providing you with the cleanest, most natural products possible.</p></span></div><div data-rid="4f70207b-a6d5-4476-a425-84b6026d6184" data-replo-repeated-index=".0.0.0.0.0.0.0.0" class="r-97v1wi alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p><strong>Sustainability & Scalability</strong><br>Our approach to aquaculture is not only sustainable but also scalable. This ensures that we can continue to provide high-quality seafood while having a minimal impact on marine ecosystems.</p></span></div><div data-rid="e823861c-40ad-463a-a01f-6af64e2614be" data-replo-repeated-index=".0.0.0.0.0.0.0.0" class="r-1mttzir alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p><span>So when you choose Seatopia's farm-raised seafood, you're opting for a product that's superior in quality, nutritional value, and environmental impact. Learn more.</span></p></span></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="4ce7d721-d9f4-438c-b4ba-56c52c3bae51" data-replo-repeated-index=".0.0.0" class="r-1t3shm6"><style>

